    (2050 : G)^4*rowProduct (neighbors 34) (values x y) (constants 34) -
      GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value factor_34 x y * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value root_34 x y^4 =
      GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value F x y*GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value relationA_34 x y + values x y 34*GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value relationB_34 x y :=
  identity_product (neighbors 34) nodes (constants 34) F relationA_34 relationB_34
    factor_34 root_34 34 2050 (by decide +kernel) x y

